---
title: Job Progress Streaming (v4.10.3)
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Tab1 as Browser Tab (Primary)
    participant Tab2 as Browser Tab (Observer)
    participant BC as BroadcastChannel
    participant WP as WordPress REST
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Worker as ScanWorker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Tab1,Tab2: Multi-Tab Coordination
    Tab1->>BC: PING_PRIMARY
    Tab1->>Tab1: Assume primary (no PONG)
    Tab2->>BC: PING_PRIMARY
    Tab1->>BC: PONG_PRIMARY
    Tab2->>Tab2: Become observer

    Note over Tab1,API: SSE Connection (Primary Only)
    Tab1->>WP: GET /recognition/jobs/{id}/stream
    WP->>API: Forward with X-Tenant-ID
    
    loop Every 100ms
        Worker->>DB: Update job progress
        API->>DB: Poll job status
        alt Progress changed
            API-->>Tab1: SSE: progress event
            Tab1->>BC: JOB_PROGRESS broadcast
            BC-->>Tab2: Receive progress
        end
    end

    Note over Worker,DB: Job Completion
    Worker->>DB: Set status=completed
    API-->>Tab1: SSE: done event
    Tab1->>BC: JOB_PROGRESS (final)
    BC-->>Tab2: Receive completion

    Note over Tab1,Tab2: Primary Closes
    Tab1->>BC: PRIMARY_CLOSING
    Tab2->>Tab2: Become primary
    Tab2->>WP: New SSE connection
